This license is **non-exclusive and non-transferable**.

This license is provided **"as is" without warranties of any kind**.

## Important

Purchasing LaunchBase grants a license to **use and modify** the template.

It does **not** transfer ownership of the source code or intellectual property.

You may build and operate unlimited websites that you own or control, but you may not redistribute, resell, sublicense, or publish the LaunchBase source code as another template or product.
